        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About</strong> <strong>Draugar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through unyielding hordes of ancient Nordic undeads. Set during WW2, you and up to <strong><i>3 other survivors</i></strong> must hold the line against the <strong>Draugar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Draugar</strong> is a co-op multiplayer, wave-based first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start off with a basic pistol, and you and your squad must fight your way through the rounds to acquire cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cash you earn to buy firearms, grenades and various perks to give you the edge over the undeads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(More details below)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.poster.avif?t=1756712689\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.webm?t=1756712689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.mp4?t=1756712689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Draugar is a game that's way more fun with friends. If you and your friends want a casual yet challenging experience to play together with plenty of action, <strong><i>Draugar</i></strong> might be a good fit for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game sees plenty of updates, and the developer plans to expand on the game's content to make the experience even more varied and replayable. I plan on adding more weapons, more perks, more maps and more customizable player cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Draugar</i></strong> ships with 3 different playable locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Testing Facility</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>An indoor facility with a trampoline. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/6cd81f445afb23c25653fa5861c3271a.avif?t=1756712689\" width=996 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dreadmill Farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Confined outdoor space with a big farmhouse and plenty of corn.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/bc80dd2a92eb9f09afed943aab3274a7.avif?t=1756712689\" width=982 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Blodhavn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A  rural church town. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/0599af12cd2911bf54fdaa387aa4ab4d.avif?t=1756712689\" width=992 height=558 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weaponry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Draugar</i></strong>'s arsenal currently consists of <i>7 guns<strong> </strong></i>and one retrievable explosive device, called the <strong><i>Nuke-In-The-Box</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Weapons can be bought two different ways:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>1) Rifle Roulette</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Rifle Roulette machine is the main way of getting weapons in <strong><i>Draugar</i></strong>. It looks like a big weapon case. It has a distinct yellow shine above it, making it stand out. This works exactly like it sounds: You pay to roll the roulette, and the Rifle Roulette machines delivers a random weapon to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/8d21c7c85b4c5e8b05b1d96a6e4a4e80.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>2) Wallbuys</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The second way of getting weapons is from wallbuys found on certain maps. It looks like a glowing weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/9ef35f5e265c4107b9f0c830750e76a2.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now, onto the actual available weaponry found in the Rifle Roulette machine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Model 1911</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The classic American semi-automatic pistol, chambered in .45 ACP. This is the starting pistol.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/44691ca88f275ceebb49c203a671f0c3.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1033 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>M1 Thompson</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>American sub-machine gun. Favored by gangsters and officers alike.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/49e52915e788a24194955f43b5be5eb3.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Model 1903 Springfield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Bolt-action rifle chambered in .30-06, used as a sniper rifle during World War 2.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/406c1c13d9bb06ff9f06aa00e303d425.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1480 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hellriegel 1915</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Austro-Hungarian automatic prototype from the Great War, uses drum mags. Often credited as a precursor to modern sub-machine guns.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/6a3139ff31968ca8cba7dfd37e5c6602.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>M1 Garand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The fan-favorite semi-automatic, standard-issue .30-06 rifle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/52a097c4f8b961d611fecb8ae77ecb9e.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>M1A1 Bazooka</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>American 60 mm rocket launcher. Great for street-sweeping pesky Draugar.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/857bf6ca9b84a60be796798fd89c831e.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>StG-44</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>German assault rifle from 1944. Features a select-fire switch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/9a3f599eb18144f4015dfd4b419f467d.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1304 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Nuke-In-The-Box</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A devastating explosive device which attracts Draugar through its cheerful music, only to disintegrate them once the tune is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/ea5c78106d0cc488dc7f856db3df553e.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1174 height=587 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perks in <strong><i>Draugar</i></strong> modify certain aspects of the player and their weapons. Perks need to be bought from Perk Machines found scattered around the map. There are currently <strong><i>5 perks</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Double-Tap</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly increases the fire rate of your guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/aedd1258ba2d8135ff60233103bdd118.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1039 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Bullet Buffet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly increases ammo and grenade-carrying capacity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/13291b84143bbf1790eb9b9a9dfaf350.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1266 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adrenaline</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly increases player health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/da409230799129505f67c9e1c2747b0f.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Panzer Chocolate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly increases player movement speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/935e2fafd71dbfedf7b86ca318a7a356.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Quick-Res</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly reduces the time it takes to revive teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/3d4c3b5305239e8a225d52f5f51ece98.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1453 height=969 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Perk locations are shuffled every game. Spawn locations are fixed, but what type of perk that spawns on a given spawn location is random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>How you can impact Draugar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you're interesting, you can join the Draugar Discord server. There you will receive every patch note as it releases, behind-the-scenes footage, discussions with fellow Draugar players and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can even have a personal impact on the game's future, as the server has a dedicated channel both for suggestions you want to see added into the game as well as a channel dedicated for bug reporting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Link to the Discord server is on the top right of this page, the Draugar store page, as well as a clickable button on the main menu screen of Draugar itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About</strong> <strong>Draugar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through unyielding hordes of ancient Nordic undeads. Set during WW2, you and up to <strong><i>3 other survivors</i></strong> must hold the line against the <strong>Draugar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Draugar</strong> is a co-op multiplayer, wave-based first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start off with a basic pistol, and you and your squad must fight your way through the rounds to acquire cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cash you earn to buy firearms, grenades and various perks to give you the edge over the undeads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(More details below)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.poster.avif?t=1756712689\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.webm?t=1756712689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.mp4?t=1756712689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Draugar is a game that's way more fun with friends. If you and your friends want a casual yet challenging experience to play together with plenty of action, <strong><i>Draugar</i></strong> might be a good fit for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game sees plenty of updates, and the developer plans to expand on the game's content to make the experience even more varied and replayable. I plan on adding more weapons, more perks, more maps and more customizable player cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Draugar</i></strong> ships with 3 different playable locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Testing Facility</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>An indoor facility with a trampoline. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/6cd81f445afb23c25653fa5861c3271a.avif?t=1756712689\" width=996 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dreadmill Farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Confined outdoor space with a big farmhouse and plenty of corn.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/bc80dd2a92eb9f09afed943aab3274a7.avif?t=1756712689\" width=982 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Blodhavn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A  rural church town. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/0599af12cd2911bf54fdaa387aa4ab4d.avif?t=1756712689\" width=992 height=558 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weaponry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Draugar</i></strong>'s arsenal currently consists of <i>7 guns<strong> </strong></i>and one retrievable explosive device, called the <strong><i>Nuke-In-The-Box</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Weapons can be bought two different ways:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>1) Rifle Roulette</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Rifle Roulette machine is the main way of getting weapons in <strong><i>Draugar</i></strong>. It looks like a big weapon case. It has a distinct yellow shine above it, making it stand out. This works exactly like it sounds: You pay to roll the roulette, and the Rifle Roulette machines delivers a random weapon to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/8d21c7c85b4c5e8b05b1d96a6e4a4e80.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>2) Wallbuys</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The second way of getting weapons is from wallbuys found on certain maps. It looks like a glowing weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/9ef35f5e265c4107b9f0c830750e76a2.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now, onto the actual available weaponry found in the Rifle Roulette machine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Model 1911</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The classic American semi-automatic pistol, chambered in .45 ACP. This is the starting pistol.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/44691ca88f275ceebb49c203a671f0c3.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1033 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>M1 Thompson</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>American sub-machine gun. Favored by gangsters and officers alike.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/49e52915e788a24194955f43b5be5eb3.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Model 1903 Springfield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Bolt-action rifle chambered in .30-06, used as a sniper rifle during World War 2.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/406c1c13d9bb06ff9f06aa00e303d425.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1480 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hellriegel 1915</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Austro-Hungarian automatic prototype from the Great War, uses drum mags. Often credited as a precursor to modern sub-machine guns.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/6a3139ff31968ca8cba7dfd37e5c6602.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>M1 Garand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The fan-favorite semi-automatic, standard-issue .30-06 rifle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/52a097c4f8b961d611fecb8ae77ecb9e.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>M1A1 Bazooka</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>American 60 mm rocket launcher. Great for street-sweeping pesky Draugar.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/857bf6ca9b84a60be796798fd89c831e.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>StG-44</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>German assault rifle from 1944. Features a select-fire switch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/9a3f599eb18144f4015dfd4b419f467d.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1304 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Nuke-In-The-Box</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A devastating explosive device which attracts Draugar through its cheerful music, only to disintegrate them once the tune is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/ea5c78106d0cc488dc7f856db3df553e.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1174 height=587 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perks in <strong><i>Draugar</i></strong> modify certain aspects of the player and their weapons. Perks need to be bought from Perk Machines found scattered around the map. There are currently <strong><i>5 perks</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Double-Tap</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly increases the fire rate of your guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/aedd1258ba2d8135ff60233103bdd118.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1039 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Bullet Buffet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly increases ammo and grenade-carrying capacity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/13291b84143bbf1790eb9b9a9dfaf350.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1266 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adrenaline</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly increases player health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/da409230799129505f67c9e1c2747b0f.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Panzer Chocolate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly increases player movement speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/935e2fafd71dbfedf7b86ca318a7a356.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Quick-Res</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Significantly reduces the time it takes to revive teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/3d4c3b5305239e8a225d52f5f51ece98.avif?t=1756712689\" width=1453 height=969 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Perk locations are shuffled every game. Spawn locations are fixed, but what type of perk that spawns on a given spawn location is random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>How you can impact Draugar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you're interesting, you can join the Draugar Discord server. There you will receive every patch note as it releases, behind-the-scenes footage, discussions with fellow Draugar players and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can even have a personal impact on the game's future, as the server has a dedicated channel both for suggestions you want to see added into the game as well as a channel dedicated for bug reporting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Link to the Discord server is on the top right of this page, the Draugar store page, as well as a clickable button on the main menu screen of Draugar itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
